        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Music provided by [Crow Producer].&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fast-forward speed of the 'fast forward' button in the game is too fast, so please be careful.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Magic Universe: Yong Xing Ying is a modern supernatural fantasy visual novel series.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One evening after graduating from high school, Yong Xing Ying invited his friends to his home for a graduation party. It was also on this night that they witnessed a series of meteors falling from the sky, accompanied by supernatural phenomena. Everything changed. After two years of quarantine, Yong Xing Ying was allowed to leave his grandfather's house. He had to adapt to the changed world, with new social interactions, mutated flora and fauna, a magical world, and Universe 25?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He had to embark on his own life - the life of Yong Xing Ying, which was also a bizarre journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's explore the world through the lens of Yong Xing Ying.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Music provided by [Crow Producer].&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fast-forward speed of the 'fast forward' button in the game is too fast, so please be careful.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Magic Universe: Yong Xing Ying is a modern supernatural fantasy visual novel series.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One evening after graduating from high school, Yong Xing Ying invited his friends to his home for a graduation party. It was also on this night that they witnessed a series of meteors falling from the sky, accompanied by supernatural phenomena. Everything changed. After two years of quarantine, Yong Xing Ying was allowed to leave his grandfather's house. He had to adapt to the changed world, with new social interactions, mutated flora and fauna, a magical world, and Universe 25?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>He had to embark on his own life - the life of Yong Xing Ying, which was also a bizarre journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's explore the world through the lens of Yong Xing Ying.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "双重魔法宇宙：永星影是一个现代超自然奇幻视觉小说系列。高中毕业生永星影在毕业后的一个晚上邀请了他的朋友们来自己家里参加毕业聚会，也是在这个晚上，他们发现一连串的流星从空中落了下来，伴随着超自然现象，一切都改变了，在度过了两年隔离生活之后，永星影被允许离开了他外祖父的房子，他不得不在世界大变样的情况下重新适应这一切，新的交际、变异动植物、魔法世界，以及25号宇宙？他得开始属于他自己的生活——永星影的生活，同时也是一段奇异经历。“音乐由[乌鸦Producer]提供”。",
